    "detailed_description": "This is a hilarious and lovely arcade fighting game. Cute characters drawn by pixel graphics, and 3D cartoon game scenes are produced.<br />\r\nUse arrow key commands to unlock skills and kills. Each of the three characters has different skills and kills, and each has a unique special skill.<br />\r\nYou can play three characters at once and then switch between them as you go. Enemies also have a variety of ways to attack, sometimes in combination.<br />\r\nEnemy bosses will also have a variety of attack methods, and powerful killing skills, need to be careful to deal with. It's a bit different from the old arcade games, you can't put coins in<br />\r\nClear.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nStory background<br />\r\nIn a ship a million light years away from the Earth, the Earth people immigrant city, held a pain fighting competition show convention.<br />\r\nTeams from every neighborhood in the city play elimination games. The winning block receives a free Current Galaxy commercial, available at the Travel Festival<br />\r\nHuge popularity, and lots of tourists. In order to generate good business for the tourism festival, every neighborhood has formed teams to participate in pain fighting competitions.<br />\r\nThe three main characters, Hyakka, Jihana sisters, and Du Xiaotong, an overseas student from Earth, participate in the competition to revive the old shop street. Their love also changed during the match.",
    "about_the_game": "This is a hilarious and lovely arcade fighting game. Cute characters drawn by pixel graphics, and 3D cartoon game scenes are produced.<br />\r\nUse arrow key commands to unlock skills and kills. Each of the three characters has different skills and kills, and each has a unique special skill.<br />\r\nYou can play three characters at once and then switch between them as you go. Enemies also have a variety of ways to attack, sometimes in combination.<br />\r\nEnemy bosses will also have a variety of attack methods, and powerful killing skills, need to be careful to deal with. It's a bit different from the old arcade games, you can't put coins in<br />\r\nClear.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nStory background<br />\r\nIn a ship a million light years away from the Earth, the Earth people immigrant city, held a pain fighting competition show convention.<br />\r\nTeams from every neighborhood in the city play elimination games. The winning block receives a free Current Galaxy commercial, available at the Travel Festival<br />\r\nHuge popularity, and lots of tourists. In order to generate good business for the tourism festival, every neighborhood has formed teams to participate in pain fighting competitions.<br />\r\nThe three main characters, Hyakka, Jihana sisters, and Du Xiaotong, an overseas student from Earth, participate in the competition to revive the old shop street. Their love also changed during the match.",
    "short_description": "\u300aPain Fighting\u300b, Good Business is a 2.5D horizontal board arcade fighting game. There are cute pixel characters and funny plot. Unlock skills and kills through directional command input. Join us now on this relaxing and enjoyable journey!",
